<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Consol names Crutchley new glass unit boss.</title>
<headline>Consol names Crutchley new glass unit boss.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Consol Ltd on Monday named Simon Crutchley, curently head of entrepreneurial group Otterbea International, as the new managing director of its Consol Glass unit.</p>
<p>The previous head of Consol Glass, Dave Spindler, recently announced plans to retire at the end of June.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
